Athea

The liquid glass implementation is based on the architecture of the following
Apache License 2.0 projects. The code is rebuilt on public Compose APIs; no
source files are copied verbatim.

- KMPLiquidGlass, https://github.com/Kashif-E/KMPLiquidGlass
  Layer backdrop and glass surface architecture (backdrop module).
  Shader sources in that project carry the notice "Copyright 2025 Kyant".

- Cloudy, https://github.com/skydoves/Cloudy
  Copyright 2022 skydoves (Jaewoong Eum). Lens shader approach.
